  ["Raster", "Units", "Spike times per unit", "Units window, time window, Plotly toggle"],
  ["PSTH", "Units + TimeIntervals", "Spikes aligned to trial events, as raster and histogram", "Units, align to, window, group trials by, sort units by, bins (1–1,000), raster, histogram, smoothing, height"],
