  ["Interval series, Events, Behavioral events", "IntervalSeries, Events, BehavioralEvents", "Events and intervals on a time axis", "Shared time controls"],
  ["Spatial series XY", "SpatialSeries", "A path in x and y", "Time overview strip"],
  ["Pose overlay", "PoseEstimation, PoseEstimationSeries", "Keypoints over video, with trails", "Trails and trail length (0.25–5 s), confidence threshold, show every keypoint, time"],
  ["Video", "ImageSeries with an external file", "The video, synced to the file’s time", "Synced to the shared cursor; controls not yet reviewed"],
  ["Dynamic table", "Any table with colnames (units, trials, electrodes)", "Rows and columns", "Sort by column, Export CSV, launch views from rows"],
  ["Figpack raster, video preview, pose", "Units, ImageSeries, PoseEstimation", "Figures built with figpack", "Launchable only"],
